@startuml uc_admin_dashboard
left to right direction
title SIGAP - Use Case: Administrasi Konten

actor "Admin / Operator" as Admin

rectangle "Sistem SIGAP" {
  usecase "Login Admin" as UC0
  usecase "Kelola Pengumuman" as UC5
  usecase "Kelola Kontak Darurat" as UC6
  usecase "Kelola Titik & Jalur Evakuasi" as UC7
}

Admin --> UC5
Admin --> UC6
Admin --> UC7

UC5 .> UC0 : <<include>>
UC6 .> UC0 : <<include>>
UC7 .> UC0 : <<include>>

note bottom of UC0
  Hak akses granular per role
  (permission matrix) masih TBD
  — lihat PRD 7.1 Isu Governance.
end note

@enduml